# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages both read this file (same format, same
# convention: a plain-text rule file at the site root). Required for
# SharedArrayBuffer, which the Python runtime worker uses for interrupting a
# running script and for the live pausable debugger (see vite.config.ts's
# matching dev/preview headers, and src/lib/python/client.ts's
# liveDebugAvailable() — without these, that check fails and the app falls
# back to the recording-driver debugger instead of breaking silently).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
